# Google Books API key, used server-side by /api/books.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com: enable "Books API", create an
# API key, then restrict it to Books API only. Use a key of its own — a Maps
# key is normally HTTP-referrer restricted, and a server request sends no
# referrer.
#
# Never rename this to NEXT_PUBLIC_*: that prefix inlines the value into the
# browser bundle and publishes the key.
#
# Without it the app still runs, falling back to the bundled sample catalogue.
GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=
